{"pageid":3493,"title":"Version 1.42.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.42.0</span>","revid":15643,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.42.0\">Version 1.42.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>October 15th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Infused_Core\" title=\"Infused Core\">infused cores</a> not working</li>\n<li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">fusion coil</a> not working when created</li>\n<li>Fixed signs not displaying text</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.42.1\">Version 1.42.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>October 20th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Changed <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow</a> plank texture due to identically with <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Tree\" title=\"Bone Tree\">Bone</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_2\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed credits not loading the contributors page</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.42.2\">Version 1.42.2</span></h2>\n<p><b>October 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Reverted <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow</a> smooth plank texture change</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow</a> wood planker form material is now white granite</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.42.3\">Version 1.42.3</span></h2>\n<p><b>October 24th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Experimenting with VR, added visible hands when in VR</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:_2\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The world is no longer very large when in VR</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.42.4\">Version 1.42.4</span></h2>\n<p><b>October 24th, 2024</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_3\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed planker repeatedly eating up those planks!</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903010033\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3493-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903010033 and revision id 15643. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Bone Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Fusion Coil","exists":true},{"title":"Hallow Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Infused Core","exists":true}],"images":[]}
